{"study_accession":"PRJNA998451","secondary_study_accession":"SRP451380","title":"Effect anti-TNF-alpha treatment on CD4+ T cell activation","description":"The experiment was designed to test how autocrine TNF-alpha impacts human CD4+ T cell activation. Naïve CD4+ T cells from healthy human blood donors were either left unactivated or activated with anti-CD3/anti-CD28 in presence of an isotype control antibody or anti-TNF-alpha antibody. RNA was extracter at 48 hours. Analysis revealed that anti-TNF-alpha treatment prevented upregulation of activation-induced T cell metabolic, signaling and effector molecules. Overall design: Naïve CD4+ T cells from healthy human blood donors were either left unactivated or activated with anti-CD3/anti-CD28 in presence of an isotype control antibody or anti-TNF-alpha antibody. RNA was extracted at 48 hours.","pubmed":"38652761","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN36705628","study_accession":"PRJNA998451","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Activated, anti-TNF-alpha Antibody Biological Replicate 6","description":"Activated, anti-TNF-alpha Antibody Biological Replicate 6","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7661115","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-08-25","attributes":[["source_name","Peripheral Blood"],["tissue","Peripheral Blood"],["cell_type","CD4+ T cell"],["treatment","anti-CD3 and anti-CD28, anti-TNF-alpha antibody"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR25421552","experiment_accession":"SRX21156414","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":14199539,"base_count":881191090,"first_public":"2024-08-25","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM7661115: Activated, anti-TNF-alpha Antibody Biological Replicate 6 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN36705629","study_accession":"PRJNA998451","blood_class":"blood_c